            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.60</title></head><body><h1>More than one account</h1><ul><li>Sign in to several Google accounts and switch between them from the account menu (or ⌃1–⌃9). Each keeps its own mail, agents, tasks and From address.</li><li>Add a work account with your organization's own Google client, so your whole Google Workspace can sign in.</li><li>While Google sign-in waits, a bar lets you copy the link for another browser, open it again, or cancel.</li><li>Agent activity on the Agents screen now leads with the label, so long subjects no longer hide it.</li></ul><p>Your current sign-in moves over automatically the first time you open this version.</p></body></html>
]]></description>
